WEBVTT

00:00:03.340 --> 00:00:05.610
After days and days of training,

00:00:05.610 --> 00:00:09.880
I gave them a full day off to take a breather.

00:00:09.880 --> 00:00:14.900
Time for them to spend as friends and as partners.

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:18.880
Time to refresh ourselves,
so that we can do our best tomorrow.

00:00:18.880 --> 00:00:23.590
But that day off came to a halt due to a sudden emergency.

00:00:23.590 --> 00:00:28.590
A small girl appeared, carrying a Relic case.

00:00:28.590 --> 00:00:31.780
The incident is quietly set in motion.

00:00:32.680 --> 00:00:37.530
Magical Girl Lyrical Nanoha StrikerS<i>
will now begin.</i>

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:46.520
But really, it’s an interesting sight

00:02:46.520 --> 00:02:48.060
seeing you in uniform.

00:02:49.000 --> 00:02:53.980
Everyone tells me I look silly in uniform, even my wife.

00:02:54.930 --> 00:02:55.940
Not at all!

00:02:55.940 --> 00:03:01.650
You look as good as you do in your armor, Admiral Chrono.

00:03:01.650 --> 00:03:04.510
Thank you, Knight Carim.

00:03:05.620 --> 00:03:06.750
Excuse me.

00:03:09.160 --> 00:03:11.120
Signum. Welcome back.

00:03:11.120 --> 00:03:13.270
Is the joint investigation conference over?

00:03:13.270 --> 00:03:15.420
Yes. Everything’s going splendidly.

00:03:15.420 --> 00:03:19.700
We just finished discussing the logistical side of Riot Force 6.

00:03:19.700 --> 00:03:22.870
We were just about to discuss the missions for here on out.

00:03:22.870 --> 00:03:25.350
You should stay and listen as well, okay?

00:03:25.350 --> 00:03:26.360
Yes, ma’am.

00:03:28.840 --> 00:03:31.720
A direct call from Hayate?

00:03:39.470 --> 00:03:40.620
Erio! Caro!

00:03:41.690 --> 00:03:43.650
Subaru! Tia!

00:03:43.650 --> 00:03:44.490
Is this her?

00:03:44.490 --> 00:03:47.070
She’s quite a mess.

00:03:47.070 --> 00:03:51.410
I believe she walked a long distance through the sewers.

00:03:53.880 --> 00:03:56.640
But she’s so small!

00:03:56.640 --> 00:03:57.330
She is.

00:03:57.330 --> 00:03:58.800
Did you seal the case?

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:00.840
Caro did.

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:04.070
There’s no chance a Gadget will find it, I believe.

00:04:04.720 --> 00:04:07.000
And this.

00:04:07.910 --> 00:04:09.640
There was another case?

00:04:09.640 --> 00:04:12.660
I’m having the Long Arch look into it.

00:04:13.600 --> 00:04:18.980
The captains and Dr. Shamal, as well as
Command Sergeant Major Rein, are heading here right now.

00:04:18.980 --> 00:04:22.320
For now, we need to secure the area and keep an eye on it.

00:04:22.320 --> 00:04:22.880
Roger!

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:34.330
I see. A Relic.

00:04:34.330 --> 00:04:38.000
The fact that a small girl was carrying it worries me.

00:04:38.000 --> 00:04:42.420
If that summoner or any Gadgets show up, we’ll have an urban battle on our hands.

00:04:42.420 --> 00:04:45.620
We need to get this matter settled as quickly as possible.

00:04:45.620 --> 00:04:47.880
Have you already contacted the other forces in the area?

00:04:47.880 --> 00:04:52.340
Yes. I contacted the City and Coastal Forces.

00:04:53.220 --> 00:04:55.810
We may need to get our trump card ready as well.

00:04:55.810 --> 00:04:57.920
I pray that doesn’t happen.

00:04:59.700 --> 00:05:03.440
Signum, you should return.

00:05:03.440 --> 00:05:04.540
Yes, ma’am.

00:05:04.540 --> 00:05:07.400
If Schach sees you off, you can get back right away.

00:05:07.400 --> 00:05:09.990
Thank you for your generosity, Knight Carim.

00:05:16.160 --> 00:05:17.880
Her physical condition is stable.

00:05:17.880 --> 00:05:21.380
There are no dangerous readings either.
There’s no need to worry.

00:05:21.380 --> 00:05:22.560
Good.

00:05:22.560 --> 00:05:23.700
What a relief!

00:05:23.700 --> 00:05:26.840
I’m sorry, everyone, that this happened during your break.

00:05:26.840 --> 00:05:28.320
Not at all.

00:05:28.320 --> 00:05:29.140
We’re all right.

00:05:29.140 --> 00:05:32.800
We’ll take the case and the girl back via helicopter.

00:05:32.800 --> 00:05:35.480
Everyone else, inspect the scene.

00:05:35.480 --> 00:05:35.980
Yes, ma’am!

00:05:37.430 --> 00:05:40.740
Nanoha, would you carry her to the helicopter?

00:05:40.740 --> 00:05:41.650
Sure.

00:05:54.420 --> 00:05:55.740
The Gadgets are here!

00:05:55.740 --> 00:06:00.630
They’re coming through the sewer in small groups.
There are 16—no, 20 of them in all!

00:06:00.630 --> 00:06:04.090
And over the sea, there are five groups of twelve!

00:06:04.090 --> 00:06:05.410
That’s a lot.

00:06:05.410 --> 00:06:06.790
What should we do?

00:06:06.790 --> 00:06:08.200
Let me think.

00:06:08.900 --> 00:06:11.210
Stars 2 to Long Arch.

00:06:11.210 --> 00:06:12.490
This is Stars 2.

00:06:12.490 --> 00:06:15.160
I was practicing over the ocean.

00:06:15.160 --> 00:06:17.390
Major Nakajima gave me permission.

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:19.590
I’m heading to the scene now.

00:06:19.590 --> 00:06:21.510
Along with one other.

00:06:21.510 --> 00:06:24.280
Ginga Nakajima of the 108th Battalion.

00:06:24.280 --> 00:06:26.840
I was investigating another incident,

00:06:26.840 --> 00:06:29.700
but it may have something to do with what you’re investigating.

00:06:29.700 --> 00:06:31.620
May I participate?

00:06:31.620 --> 00:06:33.580
Yes, please.

00:06:33.580 --> 00:06:36.040
Okay, Vita, meet up with Rein.

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:39.710
Cooperate and gain control of the southwest area of the sea.

00:06:39.710 --> 00:06:41.800
Southwest area, roger.

00:06:41.800 --> 00:06:44.800
Captain Nanoha and Captain Fate,
start with the northeast.

00:06:44.800 --> 00:06:45.630
Roger.

00:06:45.630 --> 00:06:49.360
Can I leave the helicopter to you and Shamal, Vice?

00:06:49.360 --> 00:06:50.580
Leave it to me.

00:06:50.580 --> 00:06:51.540
We’ll protect it.

00:06:51.540 --> 00:06:54.440
Ginga, meet up with Subaru’s group underground.

00:06:54.440 --> 00:06:57.420
Along the way, tell me about this other incident.

00:06:57.420 --> 00:06:58.120
Yes, ma’am.

00:06:58.890 --> 00:07:02.900
Now then, everyone, I hope you enjoyed your break.

00:07:02.900 --> 00:07:06.800
Time to get to work! Let’s go kick ass!

00:07:06.800 --> 00:07:07.710
Yes!

00:07:07.710 --> 00:07:09.420
Stand by.

00:07:09.420 --> 00:07:11.220
<b>Set up!</b>

00:08:54.370 --> 00:08:55.490
Go!

00:08:58.340 --> 00:09:02.080
Have the forwards become a little more reliable?

00:09:03.050 --> 00:09:05.830
We need them to become even more reliable.

00:09:12.420 --> 00:09:16.580
Let’s finish up this incident and give them another day off.

00:09:16.580 --> 00:09:17.160
Let’s.

00:09:17.800 --> 00:09:20.980
If we all enjoyed ourselves together,
it would be a lot of fun.

00:09:20.980 --> 00:09:21.580
Yep.

00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:27.610
Be careful, okay?

00:09:27.610 --> 00:09:28.460
I totes will!

00:09:31.200 --> 00:09:33.610
Sergeant Vice, please take care of things!

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:35.480
Yes!

00:09:35.480 --> 00:09:39.240
Storm Raider, keep them safe, okay?

00:09:39.240 --> 00:09:40.770
All right, my friend.

00:09:51.640 --> 00:09:56.350
My sisters will get the material and the case in the helicopter.

00:09:56.360 --> 00:09:59.070
Miss, head underground.

00:09:59.070 --> 00:10:02.040
Where are Knight Zest and Agito?

00:10:02.040 --> 00:10:03.400
They are elsewhere.

00:10:03.400 --> 00:10:04.860
So you’re alone?

00:10:04.860 --> 00:10:06.060
I am not alone.

00:10:10.300 --> 00:10:12.440
I have Galue.

00:10:12.440 --> 00:10:14.160
Pardon my mistake.

00:10:14.160 --> 00:10:17.860
If you need help, contact me.

00:10:17.860 --> 00:10:19.890
I’ll make it my highest priority.

00:10:20.930 --> 00:10:22.980
Let us go, Galue.

00:10:24.700 --> 00:10:27.440
To find what we’re looking for.

00:10:28.270 --> 00:10:32.120
Stars 1 and Lightning 1 are heading toward the scene.

00:10:32.120 --> 00:10:33.720
They will engage within one minute.

00:10:33.720 --> 00:10:37.190
Stars 2 has joined up with Command Sergeant Major Rein.

00:10:37.190 --> 00:10:40.160
The forwards are heading toward the Gadgets’ destination.

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:42.830
If they keep up this pace,
we’ll get the jump on them.

00:10:43.800 --> 00:10:45.810
Ginga, it’s been a while.

00:10:45.810 --> 00:10:48.710
Yeah. So Teana, you’re in command here, right?

00:10:48.710 --> 00:10:50.820
Would you give me orders?

00:10:50.820 --> 00:10:51.630
I will.

00:10:52.460 --> 00:10:56.550
For now, head to area F94 in the southwest.

00:10:56.550 --> 00:10:58.250
We’ll meet up with you along the way.

00:10:59.540 --> 00:11:01.000
F94.

00:11:02.500 --> 00:11:03.490
Roger.

00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:09.340
Ginga is your sister, right, Subaru?

00:11:09.340 --> 00:11:14.380
Yes. She taught me Shooting Arts.
She’s two years older and two ranks higher than me.

00:11:16.020 --> 00:11:16.840
Ginga,

00:11:16.840 --> 00:11:19.780
We can keep in touch and coordinate our movements with our Devices.

00:11:19.780 --> 00:11:21.280
Are you ready?

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:22.220
Yes.

00:11:22.220 --> 00:11:24.200
Blitz Caliber, I’m counting on you.

00:11:24.200 --> 00:11:25.930
Yes, sir.

00:11:42.340 --> 00:11:45.260
Stars 1 and Lightning 1 have engaged.

00:11:47.180 --> 00:11:49.880
What I found at the scene of the accident that I was called to

00:11:49.880 --> 00:11:53.350
was a bunch of destroyed Gadgets and a broken life pod.

00:11:53.350 --> 00:11:55.980
One just big enough for a child of five or six.

00:11:55.980 --> 00:12:00.470
There were marks nearby as if somebody was dragging something heavy.

00:12:00.470 --> 00:12:03.780
I was following them when you contacted me.

00:12:04.690 --> 00:12:10.160
Also, I have seen something
very similar to this life pod in another case.

00:12:10.700 --> 00:12:12.650
Me too.

00:12:12.650 --> 00:12:16.120
The primary cultivation body
called for in the Artificial Mage Project.

00:12:16.820 --> 00:12:23.970
This is just a guess, but that girl was perhaps created as material for an artificial mage.

00:12:26.430 --> 00:12:28.360
An artificial mage?

00:12:28.360 --> 00:12:35.270
Children fabricated from high-quality genetic material
who receive injections and cybernetic implants

00:12:35.270 --> 00:12:38.580
to produce the possibility of giving them powerful magical abilities.

00:12:38.580 --> 00:12:40.200
That’s an artificial mage.

00:12:40.200 --> 00:12:45.440
Ethics aside, there are many insurmountable problems using current technology,

00:12:45.440 --> 00:12:46.720
and the cost just isn’t worth it.

00:12:46.720 --> 00:12:54.120
But if someone was out of his mind,
he wouldn’t bother...

00:12:54.820 --> 00:12:58.150
Motion detected. Gadget Drones are present.

00:12:58.150 --> 00:13:01.110
Incoming! Six small Gadgets!

00:13:03.590 --> 00:13:07.500
Stars 1 and Lightning 1 have taken out group 2.

00:13:07.500 --> 00:13:08.880
It’s going well.

00:13:08.880 --> 00:13:09.790
Great.

00:13:09.790 --> 00:13:14.160
Stars 2 and Command Sergeant Major Rein have taken out group 1.

00:13:18.300 --> 00:13:20.930
Alright! It’s going well.

00:13:20.930 --> 00:13:22.560
I’m doing great too!

00:13:22.560 --> 00:13:24.060
Let’s keep going.

00:13:24.060 --> 00:13:27.180
We need to beat them quickly and help the others.

00:13:27.180 --> 00:13:28.050
Yes indeedy!

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:30.050
Why, that’s...!

00:13:33.830 --> 00:13:35.290
Reinforcements?

00:13:38.210 --> 00:13:39.970
This signal.

00:13:45.140 --> 00:13:48.290
Quattro’s Inherent Skill: Silver Curtain.

00:13:48.290 --> 00:13:52.040
These lies and illusions are going to make you dance for me.

00:14:08.910 --> 00:14:12.830
The signals in the air are multiplying.
This is impossible!

00:14:12.830 --> 00:14:14.650
What is this?

00:14:15.280 --> 00:14:17.040
Waveform check!

00:14:17.040 --> 00:14:18.580
It has to be a computer error, right?

00:14:18.580 --> 00:14:20.140
There are no problems in the system.

00:14:20.140 --> 00:14:22.120
All checks show them to be real units!

00:14:22.120 --> 00:14:25.190
Nanoha’s team says they have a visual on them too!

00:14:26.130 --> 00:14:27.380
Griffith!

00:14:28.920 --> 00:14:29.540
Yes, ma’am.

00:14:32.680 --> 00:14:34.910
The formations are composed of illusory and real units.

00:14:38.820 --> 00:14:41.480
I’m pretty sure we can keep them from breaking through the defensive line,

00:14:41.480 --> 00:14:43.260
but there sure are a lot of them.

00:14:43.260 --> 00:14:46.540
If they’re going this far, it would mean...

00:14:46.540 --> 00:14:49.220
Their main forces are heading for the helicopter or underground.

00:14:49.220 --> 00:14:53.390
Nanoha, I’ll stay here and take care of them.
You go with Vita.

00:14:53.390 --> 00:14:54.980
Fate!

00:14:54.980 --> 00:14:58.980
Even together, if we fight normally, it’ll take too much time.

00:15:00.900 --> 00:15:05.170
If I release my limiter, I can use
a wide-area spell to destroy all of them.

00:15:05.170 --> 00:15:07.160
That’s true, but...

00:15:07.160 --> 00:15:09.600
I’ve got a bad feeling about this.

00:15:09.600 --> 00:15:11.200
But Fate...

00:15:11.200 --> 00:15:12.640
Sorry to intrude.

00:15:13.240 --> 00:15:15.460
Lightning 1, this is the Long Arch.

00:15:15.900 --> 00:15:20.520
As commander, belay that plan and the release of your limiter.

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:21.470
Hayate!

00:15:21.470 --> 00:15:23.940
Hayate, why are you in your Knight Armor?

00:15:23.940 --> 00:15:26.610
I have a bad feeling too.

00:15:26.610 --> 00:15:31.020
I’ve decided to ask Chrono for permission to release <i>my</i> limiter.

00:15:31.020 --> 00:15:33.840
I’ll take care of these.

00:15:33.840 --> 00:15:38.660
Nanoha, Fate, get back to land, and defend the helicopter.

00:15:39.520 --> 00:15:42.160
Vita and Rein, you meet up with the forwards.

00:15:42.160 --> 00:15:43.580
Help them secure the case.

00:15:43.580 --> 00:15:45.040
Roger.

00:15:45.040 --> 00:15:51.470
Right now, Knight Carim and I can only grant you permission to release your limiter once apiece.

00:15:51.470 --> 00:15:54.420
It’s hard to get that renewed.

00:15:54.420 --> 00:15:56.430
Are you sure you want to use it?

00:15:56.430 --> 00:16:01.310
I don’t want to reserve power that I could have used and regret it later.

00:16:01.310 --> 00:16:05.760
Considering your location,
I cannot grant you permission for SS rank.

00:16:05.760 --> 00:16:09.230
I can only release three ranks. Will that suffice?

00:16:09.230 --> 00:16:11.390
S rank?

00:16:11.390 --> 00:16:13.660
That’s more than enough.

00:16:17.120 --> 00:16:21.280
Hayate Yagami, limiter release for three ranks has been approved.

00:16:22.230 --> 00:16:25.020
Release time, 120 minutes.

00:16:29.420 --> 00:16:31.880
Limiter release!

00:16:42.970 --> 00:16:49.570
It might be a little easier to get permission renewed since it’s not a full release, right?

00:16:50.640 --> 00:16:52.940
Not really.

00:16:52.940 --> 00:16:56.010
The G.A.S.’s top brass is really strict about this.

00:17:04.120 --> 00:17:04.860
Well, then...

00:17:04.860 --> 00:17:09.770
This will be the first time I’ve used long-range attack magic in a while.

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:18.940
Seems like they’re having some trouble above.

00:17:20.300 --> 00:17:23.020
We’re almost at the case’s location.

00:17:33.930 --> 00:17:34.720
Ginny!

00:17:34.720 --> 00:17:36.280
Ginga!

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:40.380
Let’s look for the case together.

00:17:40.380 --> 00:17:43.700
I think I finished off most of the Gadgets on the way here.

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:44.580
Aw yeah!

00:17:51.920 --> 00:17:56.820
This is Long Arch 1, Shario, to Long Arch 0, Commander Yagami.

00:17:56.820 --> 00:17:57.580
Yes?

00:17:57.580 --> 00:18:01.170
The Sighting Support System is ready.

00:18:01.170 --> 00:18:04.420
We’ve finished compensating for Schwertkreuz’s synchronization error.

00:18:05.060 --> 00:18:05.790
Roger.

00:18:05.790 --> 00:18:06.760
Sorry to bother you with this.

00:18:06.760 --> 00:18:11.980
Without Rein, I’m a total klutz with long-range sighting and accurate firing.

00:18:11.980 --> 00:18:14.810
Leave that to us.

00:18:14.810 --> 00:18:16.150
We’re all ready.

00:18:17.100 --> 00:18:18.430
Thanks.

00:18:21.900 --> 00:18:28.060
Come forth, winds of winter, and become
the fletching which falls from the heavens.

00:18:38.720 --> 00:18:41.930
Stars 1 and Lightning 1 have both evacuated to a safe area.

00:18:41.930 --> 00:18:44.350
Impact area’s safety confirmed.

00:18:44.350 --> 00:18:47.560
Okay, here comes the first wave!

00:18:50.740 --> 00:18:54.460
<b>Hræsvelgr</b>

00:18:59.860 --> 00:19:02.520
Hræsvelgr, first wave fired.

00:19:02.520 --> 00:19:05.240
Firing arc okay.

00:19:05.240 --> 00:19:06.950
About to hit Group E.

00:19:06.950 --> 00:19:09.150
Five, four...

00:19:09.150 --> 00:19:10.970
Three, two...

00:19:10.970 --> 00:19:12.700
One, zero.

00:19:17.840 --> 00:19:20.020
Group E destroyed.

00:19:20.020 --> 00:19:21.430
Next, Group B. Impact.

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:24.240
Destroyed. And A too!

00:19:24.240 --> 00:19:26.330
Second wave fired.

00:19:26.330 --> 00:19:29.040
Shari, calculate the discrimination pattern

00:19:29.040 --> 00:19:31.730
for the real units and the false ones with the data from their destruction.

00:19:31.730 --> 00:19:34.300
If there are any clues, we’ll be able to find them.

00:19:34.300 --> 00:19:36.420
I’ll find them!

00:19:39.230 --> 00:19:40.920
Fried!

00:19:47.020 --> 00:19:49.610
Subaru, can you finish it with a single blow?

00:19:49.610 --> 00:19:50.240
I can!

00:19:50.240 --> 00:19:51.740
Are you ready?

00:19:51.740 --> 00:19:52.520
Yes.

00:19:52.520 --> 00:19:54.160
Okay, follow me.

00:19:54.160 --> 00:19:54.940
Right!

00:19:54.940 --> 00:19:56.360
Here we go, buddy!

00:19:56.360 --> 00:19:58.320
Load Cartridge

00:20:01.750 --> 00:20:03.600
<b>Tri-Shield</b>

00:20:16.650 --> 00:20:18.230
<b>Divine...</b>

00:20:22.850 --> 00:20:24.700
<b>...Buster</b>

00:20:50.460 --> 00:20:51.450
I found it!

00:20:54.900 --> 00:20:55.880
What’s that sound?

00:21:15.450 --> 00:21:16.270
Erio!

00:21:30.210 --> 00:21:31.300
You’re in the way.

00:21:35.760 --> 00:21:36.500
Caro!

00:21:54.980 --> 00:21:56.100
Hey!

00:21:56.100 --> 00:21:57.540
Hey, girl!

00:21:57.540 --> 00:21:59.410
That’s dangerous!

00:21:59.410 --> 00:22:00.530
Don’t touch that!

00:22:00.530 --> 00:22:02.590
Give it here!

00:22:05.540 --> 00:22:07.450
Sorry to play rough.

00:22:08.300 --> 00:22:11.390
But this really is something dangerous.

00:22:14.240 --> 00:22:15.120
Lulu.

00:22:15.420 --> 00:22:17.940
Close your eyes on the count of three.

00:22:17.940 --> 00:22:19.420
Ready?

00:22:20.220 --> 00:22:21.310
One.

00:22:21.310 --> 00:22:22.760
Two.

00:22:24.180 --> 00:22:26.420
<b>Starling’s Howl</b>

00:22:54.430 --> 00:22:59.600
Geez! This is what you get for going out without telling us.

00:22:59.600 --> 00:23:01.400
Lulu, you and Galue too.

00:23:01.400 --> 00:23:02.520
Agito.

00:23:03.440 --> 00:23:05.320
I was really worried.

00:23:05.320 --> 00:23:08.270
Well, it’s okay now, Lulu.

00:23:08.270 --> 00:23:12.510
After all, I, Sword Faerie of the Raging Fire,

00:23:14.240 --> 00:23:16.700
Agito is finally here!

00:23:22.740 --> 00:23:28.180
Come on, all of you, bring it on!

00:25:18.240 --> 00:25:22.420
A new shadow appears, and our uneasiness continues.

00:25:22.420 --> 00:25:28.080
No matter what shows up, no matter who comes,
I’ll get through it and protect everyone.

00:25:34.570 --> 00:25:35.920
Take off!
